OL,3,GNEWSACare home ordered to make
OL,4,Aimprovements by inspectors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home in Leicestershire has been
OL,7,Ftold to improve after inspectors found
OL,8,Fsome residents had run out of medicine
OL,9,Fand missed hospital appointments.
OL,11,FWhite Acres in Shepshed, which cares
OL,12,Ffor people with learning disabilities
OL,13,Fand autism, was downgraded by the Care
OL,14,FQuality Commission (CQC) from "good" to
OL,15,F"requires improvement" following an
OL,16,Finspection in August.
OL,18,FInspectors also said there was a risk
OL,19,Fof infection spread when an unlocked
OL,20,Fbin containing clinical waste was left
OL,21,Fin an area open to the street.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
