OL,3,GNEWSACare home ordered to make
OL,4,Aimprovements by inspectors
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Prime Life, which
OL,7,Fruns the care home, said it was "hugely
OL,8,Fdisappointed" with the outcome, but it
OL,9,Fwould work to return the service to its
OL,10,F"optimum level".
